[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_01_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_01_0010","text":"……这就是\nSHHis作为组合的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_01_0020","text":"第一套服装，对吧。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_01_0030","text":"嗯，没错。\n怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_01_0040","text":"……嗯。\n我觉得挺好的。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_01_0050","text":"最初的服装和乐曲，\n是塑造一个组合形象的东西。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_01_0060","text":"我觉得非常重要。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_01_0070","text":"是啊。\n我觉得这是一套华丽又帅气的服装。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_01_0080","text":"……嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_01_0090","text":"得做出配得上这套服装的\n歌声……还有舞蹈才行。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_01_0100","text":"──我们"}]
